data: {"id": "b05e7a10798d477f-thinking-layer-206", "run_id": "b05e7a10798d477f", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "该 Pod 仍处于 `ContainerCreating` 状态。根据 `LayerOutput` 的指令，我需要为这个异常类型选择对应的 Runbook 进行诊断。`ContainerCreating` 通常指向镜像拉取失败 (`pod-imagepull-failed.md`)、卷挂载失败 (`pod-volume-mount-failed.md`) 或沙箱创建失败 (`pod-sandbox-create-failed.md`)。\n\n首先，我将获取最相关的 `pod-imagepull-failed.md` 手册，因为镜像拉取问题是 `ContainerCreating` 阶段最常见的异常原因。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789049660871}

